    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\angle BAC=90^\\circ$.\n\nThe gradients of $AB$ and $AC$ are $3$ and $-\\dfrac13$, whose product is $-1$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}m_{AB}&=\\frac{10-4}{5-3}\\\\m_{AB}&=3\\\\m_{AC}&=\\frac{7-4}{-6-3}\\\\m_{AC}&=-\\frac13\\\\m_{AB}m_{AC}&=3\\left(-\\frac13\\right)\\\\m_{AB}m_{AC}&=-1\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore $AB\\perp AC$, so $\\angle BAC=90^\\circ$ and $ABC$ is a right-angled triangle.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
